# A chart that divides exactly into pages ends on a full page. Off by one there
# and the last page names a next that answers with nothing, forever.

title: a last page that is exactly full still claims a page after it
file: internal/ledgerhttp/ledgerhttp.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestTheLastPageCarriesNoNext -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
	more := len(rows) > page
--- after
	more := len(rows) >= page
